# Two incident reports stay local. They are real forensic records and are kept intact on disk, but
# they name the private workspace the incidents happened in, along with its absolute paths and
# thread ids. docs/incidents/2026-07-30-multi-session-surface-race.md carries none of that and is
# tracked normally, so this ignores the two files rather than the directory.
docs/incidents/2026-07-30-codex-bridge-false-delivery.md
